{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51508","headline":"松江秋书 · 陆龟蒙","name":"松江秋书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"张翰深心怕祸机，不缘蓴脆与鲈肥。\n如何狗世浮沉去，可要抛官独自归？\n风度野烟侵醉帽，雨来秋浪溅吟衣。\n无人好尚无人责，吟啸低头又掩扉。\n（《百城烟水》四《吴江》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51508.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51508","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}